# Frontend (Next.js)

## Stack

- **Next.js App Router** + **React** + **TypeScript** (strict)
- **Tailwind** + **shadcn/ui** (prefer primitives over custom one-offs)
- App lives in repo-root `frontend/` (backend under `backend/` when restructured)
- Versions: pin in `frontend/package.json` and `docs/tech-stack.md`

## Contract (do not invent APIs)

- Headers / auth flow / ports: [docs/fe-contract.md](../../docs/fe-contract.md)
- ApiIds / routes: [docs/services-mvp.md](../../docs/services-mvp.md)
- Hit **gateway** `:8080` only — never call service ports from the browser
- Every `/api/**` call: `X-API-Key` + `Authorization: Bearer` when authenticated
- After org picker: send `X-Organization-Id`
- Profile: prefer `/api/v1/users/me` (not auth `/me`)
- Documents upload/list: **out of UAT** — do not build UI for stubs

## Auth

- **No NextAuth** — custom session vs CollabFlow JWT (`accessToken` / `refreshToken`)
- Master admin → `/admin/*`; members → product routes (org picker when required)
- Persist session in one place (`lib/auth/session`); clear on logout
- Never commit real `API_KEY` / tokens; use `frontend/.env.local` + `.env.example`

## Layout conventions

```
frontend/app/
  (auth)/     login, verify-email, select-org
  (admin)/    master-admin only
  (app)/      member product shell
frontend/lib/api/   client + domain modules (auth, admin, …)
frontend/components/ui/   shadcn
```

- Route groups for layouts/guards; keep URLs clean (`/login`, `/admin/users`)
- Forms: React Hook Form + Zod
- Typed envelope: `{ success, message, data, timestamp }`

## Scrollbars & overflow

- **Never leave the browser default scrollbar** (thick grey + arrow buttons) — Windows often ignores webkit thumb styling
- Prefer `SoftScroll` (`components/ui/soft-scroll.tsx`) for boards / sidebars / wide tables
  - `orientation`: `horizontal` | `vertical` | `both`
  - Thumb only renders when that axis overflows
  - Click track to jump · drag thumb to scroll (pointer events)
- Or `scroll-hide` to remove native chrome entirely; `scroll-area` is CSS fallback only
- Hover / popover panels that can clip inside overflow must **portal to `document.body`** with `fixed` placement (flip above/below)

## Role / status / priority color

- Distinct token sets: status, priority, **and org roles** (`--role-owner|admin|member`) — do not reuse the same green/grey for Owner vs Admin vs Member
- Prefer `StatusChip` / `PriorityChip` / `RoleChip` over ad-hoc Badge colors

## Guardrails

- Small vertical slices (one flow per PR when possible)
- Do not expand past agreed FE slice (auth + admin first)
- Update `docs/fe-contract.md` / `frontend/README.md` in the same change when headers or env change
